    "title": "April Fools’ Day 2026: 10 fun prank ideas to try on friends",
    "text": "April Fools’ Day is all about laughter, harmless tricks, and creating fun memories. If you’re planning to prank your friends this year, here are 10 easy and safe ideas that will leave everyone smiling.CLASSIC FAKE CALL PRANKAsk someone to call your friend pretending to be from a delivery service or bank. Make it sound real but don’t drag it too far.SWITCH SUGAR WITH SALTSwap sugar with salt in the sugar jar and watch their reaction when they take the first sip of tea or coffee. SCREENSHOT PRANKTake a screenshot of your friend’s phone home screen and set it as wallpaper. Hide the apps they’ll keep tapping in confusion.AUTO-CORRECT TRICKChange a common word in their phone auto-correct settings to something funny. Every message they type will turn hilarious.FAKE SPILL PRANKCreate a fake coffee spill using glue and paint on a surface like a laptop or table. It looks real but causes no damage.BROKEN SCREEN WALLPAPERSet a cracked screen image as their phone wallpaper. They’ll think their screen is damaged.MOUSE SENSOR PRANKPlace a small piece of tape under the mouse sensor. The mouse won’t work, leaving them puzzled.FAKE LOTTERY WINTell your friend they’ve won a contest or prize. Build excitement before revealing the joke.INVISIBLE INK MESSAGEWrite a message using lemon juice on paper. When heated, the message appears perfect for a surprising prank.BACKWARD CLOCK PRANKChange the time on their phone or wall clock slightly. Watch them panic thinking they’re late.KEEP IT FUN AND HARMLESSAlways make sure your pranks are safe, respectful, and don’t hurt anyone’s feelings. The goal is to laugh together, not embarrass or upset someone.April Fools’ Day is the perfect excuse to add some humour to your day. Try these simple pranks with your friends and make sure everyone ends up laughing together.- EndsTOP HEADLINESPublished By: Chaitanya DhawanPublished On: Mar 31, 2026 14:51 IST",
